  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your translucence lasts longer, and you can even force your invisibility to resume.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Lingering Invisiblity<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your concealment you gain after the expiration of an invisibility effect lasts for 2 rounds per minute of duration the invisibility effect had remaining (minimum 2 rounds). This occurs even if the invisibility is from an item or a spell cast on you by another creature. While you have this concealment, you can spend one use of mythic power to become invisible again, with a duration equal to the duration the invisibility effect had remaining, minus 1 minute (minimum 1 minute).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc71\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
